        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6c543b70-4a02-5501-8e50-4a634ec23e49",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Innocence Mission, Starflyer 59\n- People: Karen Peris, Don Peris, Mike Bitts, Steve Brown, Jason Martin, Ronnie Martin\n- Places: Lancaster, Pennsylvania; Riverside, California\n- Releases: Tending the Rose Garden, Can't Stop Eating\n- Topics: folk rock, alternative rock, Catholic rock, indie rock\n\nFacts:\n- The Innocence Mission was formed in Lancaster, Pennsylvania in the early 1980s after its members met during a Catholic school production of \"Godspell.\"\n- Tending the Rose Garden is the 1986 debut EP by The Innocence Mission, a Catholic rock band.\n- Starflyer 59 is an alternative rock band from Riverside, California that was founded in 1993 by Jason Martin.\n- The Innocence Mission is an American folk rock band centered on husband-and-wife singer-songwriters Karen Peris and Don Peris.\n- The Innocence Mission includes Mike Bitts on bass guitar and Steve Brown on drums.\n- The Innocence Mission has been stylized as \"the innocence mission\" on all releases since 1995.\n- Jason Martin is the brother of Ronnie Martin of Joy Electric.\n- Can't Stop Eating is an EP released by Starflyer 59, an indie rock band.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "00fbd615-6a9f-5f41-a740-4ef32b04abf5",
        "text": "Page: The Innocence Mission. Sentence: The Innocence Mission (stylized as the innocence mission on all releases since 1995) is an American folk rock band centered on husband-and-wife singer-songwriters Karen and Don Peris.\nPage: The Innocence Mission. Sentence: The group, including Mike Bitts (bass guitar) and Steve Brown (drums), was formed in Lancaster, Pennsylvania in the early 1980s when the members met during a Catholic school production of \"Godspell\".\nPage: Starflyer 59. Sentence: Starflyer 59 is an alternative rock band from Riverside, California that was founded in 1993 by Jason Martin, brother of Ronnie Martin of Joy Electric.\nPage: Tending the Rose Garden. Sentence: Tending the Rose Garden is the 1986 debut EP by Catholic rock band The Innocence Mission.\nPage: Can't Stop Eating (EP). Sentence: Can't Stop Eating is an EP released by Indie rock band Starflyer 59.",
